node_modules/
dist/
dist-offline/
# The single-file offline build. Regenerate with `pnpm --filter <app> build:offline`
# rather than committing a megabyte of inlined bundle.
offline/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude / AI agent config (skills, local settings) — not part of the shipped project
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Internal planning/business docs (pricing, decisions, NDA-adjacent notes) — local reference
# only, never part of the public shipped project.
docs/decisions.md
docs/briefs/

# Commercial licence documents. These are contracts, not product: the subscription and
# lifetime terms are what customers are sold, and the per-customer ones carry a real name and
# a purchase reference. The licence text that belongs in public is the per-app LICENSE.md.
docs/licenses/

# External reference clone (unlicensed upstream — reference only, re-clone if missing):
# git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/nelsonjchen/unofficial-makerworld-parametric-model-maker-openscad-docs vendor/pmm-docs
vendor/pmm-docs/

# OpenSCAD render-loop working output (covers/ stays tracked — it is a deliverable)
**/renders/

# pnpm content-addressable store (local cache)
.pnpm-store/

# Third-party reference code (competitor .scad, upstream sources) — reference only.
# Keep OUT of this public repo to avoid redistributing others' code.
docs/reference/

# opal-suite planning & research docs (local working notes, not part of the shipped app)
apps/opal-suite/*.md
apps/opal-suite/planning/

# MakerLab submissions and private agreements
**/makerlab/agreements/
**/makerlab/launch/

# MakerLab submissions and private packages
**/makerlab/
**/source 3d models/
**/tests/
packages/manifold-noeval/README.md

# Paid feature source (anything sold rather than given away). The public
# build never ships these — the branch that mounts them is fenced behind the MAKERLAB
# compile-time flag and resolved through `virtual:pro-pack` — but the SOURCE would still be
# readable in a public repo, which is the whole thing people are paying for.
apps/*/src/pro/

# Unreleased apps. This repo is public and it is the live site, so an app in it is an
# announcement — the whole design, before it is finished and before it is decided whether it
# ships free, paid or at all. These two stay on disk and stay pnpm workspace members, so
# `pnpm --filter foldbox dev` works exactly as it did; they are simply not published yet.
# Add the app back here and to generators.json (with a build + copy step in deploy.yml, or
# the hub card is a 404) on the day it ships.
#
# They were tracked until 2026-08-17, so both are still readable in the history — removing
# them from HEAD hides them from anyone browsing, not from anyone looking.
apps/foldbox/
apps/laser-slot/

# Blocks and 3mf files
**/blocks/**/*.3mf
**/blocks.3mf
*.3mf

# Unignore public assets 3mf files
!apps/*/public/**/*.3mf

# AI OpenSCAD Research
docs/openscad-ai-research/
